[00:00.000] 作词 : Ira Gershwin/George Gershwin
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Ira Gershwin/George Gershwin
[00:14.169]When the mellow moon begins to beam,
[00:19.538]Every night I dream a little dream;
[00:25.913]And of course Prince Charming is the theme:
[00:33.324]The he for me.
[00:41.192]Although I realize as well as you
[00:47.568]It is seldom that a dream comes true,
[00:56.497]To me it's clear
[01:01.616]That he'll appear.
[01:09.183]Some day he'll come along,
[01:15.036]The man I love;
[01:18.673]And he'll be big and strong,
[01:23.283]The man I love;
[01:27.648]And when he comes my way,
[01:32.257]I'll do my best to make him stay.
[01:45.398]He'll look at me and smile
[01:51.518]I'll understand;
[01:55.453]And in a little while
[01:59.796]He'll take my hand;
[02:04.664]And though it seems absurd,
[02:09.781]I know we both won't say a word.
[02:23.174]Maybe I will meet him Sunday,
[02:29.056]Maybe Monday maybe not;
[02:40.694]Still I'm sure to meet him one day
[02:47.790]Maybe Tuesday
[02:52.406]Will be my good news day.
[02:59.772]He'll build a little home
[03:04.408]Just meant for two;
[03:08.778]From which I'll never roam
[03:13.379]Who would? Would you?
[03:18.250]And so all else above,
[03:22.859]I'm waiting for the man I love
[04:12.404]Maybe I will meet him Sunday,
[04:18.817]Maybe Monday -- maybe not;
[04:29.554]Still I'm sure to meet him one day
[04:35.923]Maybe Tuesday
[04:40.790]Will be my good news day.
[04:47.434]He'll build a little home
[04:52.545]Just meant for two;
[04:56.658]From which I'll never roam
[05:01.491]Who would? Would you?
[05:05.601]And so all else above,
[05:10.007]I'm waiting for the man I love
